{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Beware of Space Dragons is a short incremental experience about upgrading a space dragon from a small creature to the most powerful being in space. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The dragon will automatically follow your mouse, guide it to collect resources.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686670/extras/horizontal_1.png?t=1745960762\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Eat asteroids, stars and space derelict to gather XP.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686670/extras/horizontal_2.png?t=1745960762\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use the XP you got to buy upgrades in a big skilltree, such as more strength, size, XP gain, and much more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686670/extras/horizontal_4.png?t=1745960762\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Become the greatest space dragon the cosmos has ever seen!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686670/extras/horizontal_3.png?t=1745960762\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3686670?t=1745960762","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3686670?t=1745960762","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686670/52957935fff987faf791780de3d9974e9d575399/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745960762","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686670/52957935fff987faf791780de3d9974e9d575399/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745960762","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description"